<title>USA: Metromail names fifth director.</title>
<headline>Metromail names fifth director.</headline>
<dateline>LOMBARD, Ill. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metromail Corp said Tuesday it elected Robert McCormack as the fifth member of its board and first outside director.</p>
<p>McCormack is a founding partner of Trident Capital Inc, a private equity investment firm based in Chicago and Menlo Park, Calif.</p>
<p>Metromail, previously a unit of R.R. Donnelley &amp; Sons Co, completed its public offering in June.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
